---
// src/components/About/About.astro
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 md:py-32 scroll-mt-16">
  <div class="section-container">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <h2 class="section-title">About Me</h2>
      <div class="section-line"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-10 md:gap-16 items-start">
      <!-- Bio text -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-5" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8;">
        <p class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
          I'm a software engineer based in Ahmedabad, India, with nearly three years of professional experience building backend systems and full-stack applications. I joined
          <a href="https://www.esparkbiz.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="keyword-link">eSparkBiz</a>
          in January 2024, where I've been working on real-world client projects across different business domains.
        </p>

        <p class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
          I work across the full stack with
          <span style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">TypeScript, Node.js, NestJS, React.js</span>, and <span style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">PostgreSQL</span>.
          On the backend, I architect REST APIs, design database schemas, navigate
          <span style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">microservices architectures</span>, apply
          <span style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">CQRS</span> patterns, and build asynchronous message-driven workflows using
          <span style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">RabbitMQ</span>.
        </p>

        <p class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.3s;">
          On the frontend, I build responsive, production-ready web applications using
          <span style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">React.js</span>,
          ranging from interactive admin portals and visual workflow canvas builders to mobile progressive web apps (PWAs). I care deeply about writing clean, modular code that future developers can understand, maintain, and extend without friction.
        </p>

        <p class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.4s;">
          Beyond day-to-day delivery, I'm actively strengthening my understanding of system design, database internals, distributed systems, and API architecture patterns. I believe that becoming a better engineer isn't just about writing more code — it's about understanding the deeper trade-offs that make systems reliable at scale.
        </p>

        <p class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.5s; color: var(--color-text-primary);">
          Here are some technologies I work with regularly:
        </p>

        <!-- Skills quick list -->
        <ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 font-mono text-sm reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.6s; color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
          {['Node.js', 'TypeScript', 'NestJS / Express.js', 'React.js', 'RabbitMQ / CQRS', 'PostgreSQL / MongoDB'].map(skill => (
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span style="color: var(--color-accent-primary);">▹</span>
              {skill}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Right column: Stats / metadata -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-4 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.3s;">
        <!-- Profile info card -->
        <div class="card p-6 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" style="color: var(--color-accent-primary);">
              <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
            </svg>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Location</p>
              <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Ahmedabad, Gujarat, India</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" style="color: var(--color-accent-primary);">
              <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/>
            </svg>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Current Role</p>
              <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Software Developer at eSparkBiz</p>
              <p class="text-xs mt-1" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Jan 2024 – Present</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" style="color: var(--color-accent-primary);">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/>
            </svg>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Experience</p>
              <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Nearly 3 years</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" style="color: var(--color-accent-primary);">
              <polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/>
            </svg>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Primary Focus</p>
              <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Full Stack Development</p>
              <p class="text-xs mt-1" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Distributed Systems & Modern Web Apps</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Currently learning / exploring -->
        <div class="card p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-3" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Currently exploring</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {['System Design', 'Java / Spring Boot', 'HLD / LLD', 'DSA Patterns'].map(item => (
              <span class="tech-tag">{item}</span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
